  "description": "Two years ago, Ha Eun-Woo had a one-night stand at a school festival. And it was with actor Han Ji-Woon, who had been his goal and dream, all while dressed up as a woman…! The experience that day remained as an unpleasant memory for Eun-Woo, and Ji-Woon, who had declared temporary retirement due to drunk driving, appeared in front of Eun-Woo, saying that he was his junior. Eun-Woo slapped Ji-Woon in the ear when he greeted him… (Source: Lezhin, translated)",
